abstract: >
  A deep learning pipeline detecting, tracking, and identifying drainage
  events in supraglacial lakes on the Greenland Ice Sheet, using U-Net
  segmentation of Sentinel-2 imagery to detect 117 high-confidence
  drainage events across the 2019 melt season.
